+/*
+ * ENOENT from pathname lookup or fs_roots_radix is not lifetime absence.
+ * Legacy deletion can remove both while inode/mount/file aliases retain a
+ * root object. Every externally published fs root stays in lifetime_roots
+ * until its final put; the list holds no reference of its own.
